{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1668.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f34ed0f4970de0fc20f8fb227186a3b614f831227401c8adfac08d7c6e06b45e","ja":"恵美のイチオシメニュー","zh":"惠美力荐菜单","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1668.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"571f1916a6c01d229e61185fa413fe59b2e42276d4ba315ad83414cb6f50353f","ja":"その後、3人は限界まで\nいろんなメニューを食べたけれど……","zh":"之后，3个人虽然拼尽全力\n吃了各种各样的菜品，但是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1668.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"70b8d5bf0e5e20629fc19b127316935b371dd4463bb839d0b3f7a71dfccfeb78","ja":"イチオシメニュー、決まらないよ～！\nどうしよ～！","zh":"主打菜品定不下来呀～！\n怎么办呀～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1668.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1d90e25ea4cbabc8ee08d287ede7a4f1dda3b9b80d4d00afc393d753aa397200","ja":"うーん……あ、そういえば雑誌の企画のお仕事だよね？\nそれなら、読者層も気にしてみるといいかも。","zh":"嗯……啊，说起来这是杂志企划的工作吧？\n既然这样，稍微注意一下读者群体或许会比较好。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1668.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"c319f9d09c2b88bbcb99f6fd2a7252b60f23c414dbc24aae30cf784cfeb85b0e","ja":"なるほど！　えっと、たしかあの雑誌は、\nアタシら世代向けって感じだったかな～。","zh":"原来如此！呃，我记得那本杂志，\n好像是面向我们这个年龄段的吧～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1668.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"53019e600a353c9b49fae38ee6adadf2ef3c22cf19e0ecef3a71e5789c2c91d9","ja":"それじゃあ、恵美ちゃんがよく食べてるものを\nイチオシにすれば、バッチリなんじゃない？","zh":"既然这样，把惠美经常吃的东西\n当作头号推荐，不就正合适了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1668.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"a3937bbacfe870842fc0536c5f2298cd01d4d52040480c12b0f64697ab5d1cd5","ja":"アタシ？　う～ん……ドリンクバー以外で\nよく頼んでるのってなんだろ……？","zh":"我吗？唔～……除了畅饮饮料吧以外，\n我平时经常点的是什么来着……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1668.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"1de6936aacc65a847cf63f90ca8630ea85b7c1645cbdcd48de3e1566d0df760c","ja":"こんなにたくさんメニューがあるんだもんね。\nいつも違うものを頼むの？","zh":"有这么丰富的菜单呢。\n你每次都会点不一样的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1668.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"581ac2cf7640ea8e5bfd1dad21c4754046f6b594aece206f87e5b4d12dbf4a77","ja":"う～ん……友達とシェアするのに、\n別々のを注文して、って感じかな～。あ、じゃあ……。","zh":"嗯～……感觉就像是和朋友分着吃，\n各点各的那样吧～。啊，那不如……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1668.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"9bd81dbab70832e55c6c639df0ccd1a73392b9f4cc632a011437052988e29c59","ja":"アタシのイチオシメニューは、シェアしやすいもの！？\n……って、こんな決め方でいいのかな～？","zh":"我最推荐的菜品，竟然是方便大家分着吃的东西！？\n……不过，这样来决定真的好吗～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1668.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"54d4841f0ab56c07de1b2ca22c4ee11173e8f413689fce6d303cfd2497471960","ja":"いいんじゃないかニャ～！\nみんなでファミレスに行きたい、って気持ちになるし！","zh":"挺不错的喵～！\n让人很想和大家一起去家庭餐厅呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1668.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"8046894f8cb473d594040adb8fe8412d57991cdd2dad83370da724b24fe5d948","ja":"うん♪　恵美ちゃんが知ってるファミレスの良さ、\nそれならきっと伝わると思うよ！","zh":"嗯♪如果是恵美所了解的家庭餐厅的好处，\n那样一定能传达给大家的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1668.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"309c6dcff734d845add1ea84409935661393d0469fb4b76e473bc5b92a028b49","ja":"ホント？　そっか……へへっ、ありがと！\nふたりのおかげで、なんとか決められそうだよ～！","zh":"真的吗？这样啊……嘿嘿，谢谢你们！\n多亏了你们两个，感觉总算能定下来了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1668.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"d0370f8194c6df99b84f79301bc5173e9f86dc2dce1fae31d7183f34e8320746","ja":"……ねぇ、デザートならまだギリいける？\n最後にチョコパフェ、シェアしよっ♪","zh":"……那个，如果是甜点的话，还吃得下吗？\n最后分着吃一份巧克力芭菲吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
